  "description": "Optional MediatR integration for LineTen.Messaging v3. Provides\n      PublishContextBehavior<TRequest,TResponse>, a pipeline behaviour that opens an\n      IPublishContext scope around the inner handler, commits buffered publishes on success,\n      and discards them on exception. Requires AddInProcessPublishBuffer() from\n      LineTen.Messaging.DependencyInjection. MediatR itself is an optional dependency —\n      this package is NOT referenced by Abstractions or DependencyInjection.",
